ufffd/#11\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#12\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#16\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#18\\ufffd] (from your IP address, device, and content), as well as insights drawn from them. Data shared may relate to topics you find sensitive. [\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#17\\ufffd][\\ufffd#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd#17\\ufffd] Data from Google Workspace is used and human reviewed per the \\ufffd#11\\ufffdGemini Apps Privacy Notice[\\ufffd/#9\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#11\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#12\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#16\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#18\\ufffd]. Data Gemini shares with other Google services is used per the \\ufffd#12\\ufffdGoogle Privacy Policy[\\ufffd/#9\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#11\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#12\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#16\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#18\\ufffd], including for product improvement. [\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#17\\ufffd][\\ufffd#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd#17\\ufffd] Your choices here don't change other personalization settings, whether other services exchange data, whether Google Workspace uses data to improve its own services, and Gemini's use of public data. [\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#17\\ufffd][\\ufffd#2\\ufffd|\\ufffd#7\\ufffd|\\ufffd#14\\ufffd]You\\u2019re in control[\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#7\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#14\\ufffd][\\ufffd#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd#17\\ufffd] You can change these choices in your Gemini settings and \\ufffd#16\\ufffdmanage and delete your Gemini Apps activity[\\ufffd/#9\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#11\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#12\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#16\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#18\\ufffd] anytime. [\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#17\\ufffd][\\ufffd#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd#17\\ufffd]\\ufffd#18\\ufffdLearn more about personalization with Connected Apps[\\ufffd/#9\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#11\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#12\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#16\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#18\\ufffd][\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#10\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#13\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#15\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#17\\ufffd]\");var b=\n_.Ex(\"\\ufffd#2\\ufffd[\\ufffd#3\\ufffd|\\ufffd#6\\ufffd|\\ufffd#8\\ufffd] To respond to you, Gemini can access and manage Workspace content via your \\ufffd0\\ufffd account, even if it\\u2019s not already open in Chrome. \\ufffd#5\\ufffdLearn more[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#7\\ufffd][\\ufffd/#3\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd][\\ufffd#3\\ufffd|\\ufffd#6\\ufffd|\\ufffd#8\\ufffd] Gemini can share parts of your chats\\u2013which may contain your Workspace content\\u2013and other relevant info (e.g., your time zone) with Workspace and other apps you connect. \\ufffd#7\\ufffdLearn how your content is used[\\ufffd/#5\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#7\\ufffd][\\ufffd/#3\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd][\\ufffd#3\\ufffd|\\ufffd#6\\ufffd|\\ufffd#8\\ufffd] Shared chats and info may be used to improve Google Workspace services. [\\ufffd/#3\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#6\\ufffd|\\ufffd/#8\\ufffd]\\ufffd/#2\\ufffd You can disconnect the Workspace app from the Apps page anytime. \");\nreturn[[\"p13nContent\",\"\"],[\"nonP13nContent\",\"\"],[\"connectButton\",\"\"],\" Google Workspace smart settings \",\" Connect Google Workspace to Gemini? \",\" Connect Google Workspace \",\" Turn on both Smart features and personalization settings \",\" Declined \",\"Ask again \",\" Continue \",\"No thanks\",\"Connect\",\" Show more \",a,b,[3,\"cdkTrapFocus\",\"cdkTrapFocusAutoCapture\",\"id\",\"imgUrl\"],[\"title\",\"\"],[\"data-test-id\",\"workspace-eecc-consent-title\",1,\"consent-title\",\"gds-title-m\"],[\"data-test-id\",\"tool-consent-title\",\n1,\"consent-title\",\"gds-title-m\"],[1,\"gds-body-m\"],[\"actions\",\"\",1,\"buttons-container\"],[\"data-test-id\",\"declined-chip\",1,\"consent-declined-chip\",\"gds-label-l\"],[4,\"ngTemplateOutlet\"],[\"mat-stroked-button\",\"\",\"data-test-id