                "name": "f.req",
                "value": "%5Bnull%2C%22%5B%5B%5C%22Hey%20G%2C%20I%20am%20Veronica%20Cisneros%2C%20making%20this%20request%20using%20public%20computers%20from%20the%20San%20Carlos%20Public%20Library%20in%20San%20Mateo%20County%20California%2C%20on%20September%2028th%2C%202026%2C%20around%2011%3A16%20hrs%20PDT.%20Please%20help%20me%20code%20a%20webpage%20that%20plays%20QuickTime%20(%20file%20extension%20.mov%3F)%20videos%20through%20the%20browser%2C%20and%20from%20which%20I%20can%20extract%20frames%20(still%20images%20of%20a%20given%20timestamp).%C2%A0%5C%5Cn%5C%5CnFor%20the%20video%20player%2C%20please%20add%3A%5C%5Cn-%20live%20stats%20on%20a%20side%20bar%2C%20so%20that%20the%20timestamp%2C%20video%20type%2C%20encoding%2C%20length%20or%20duration%2C%20and%20frame%20number%20information%20is%20displayed.%C2%A0%5C%5Cn-%20buttons%2C%20back%2C%20play%2C%20pause%2C%20forward%2C%20take%20a%20still%20image%20from%20the%20video%20and%20speeds%20.25x%2C%20.5x%2C%20.75x%2C%201x%2C%201.25x%2C%201.5x%2C%201.75x%2C%202x%2C%20and%203x.%5C%5Cn%5C%5CnPlease%20make%20every%20interactive%20elements%20in%20the%20page%20(i.e.%2C%20input%20to%20select%20the%20video%2C%20buttons%20to%20press%20next%2C%20play%2C%20extract%20frame%2C%20etc.)%20accessible%20through%20keyboard.%20In%20other%20words%2C%20these%20should%20be%20reachable%20when%20I%20press%20tab%2C%20and%20the%20input%20to%20select%20the%20file%20picker%20must%20open%20when%20I%20press%20Enter.%C2%A0%5C%5Cn%5C%5CnDo%20not%20use%20any%20third%20party%20libraries.%20Rely%20only%20on%20Chrome%20API.%5C%5Cn%5C%5CnThe%20video%20was%20captured%20through%20a%20Vivitar%20AquaSnap%20camera%2C%20while%20configured%20for%204K%20resolution%2C%20and%20when%20I%20opened%20a%20small%20video%20file%20with%20the%20notepad%20program%20in%20windows%2C%20the%20first%20few%20lines%20are%20(I%20expected%20to%20see%20hints%20of%20the%20encoding%2C%20which%20I%20have%20seen%20in%20other%20video%20files.%20But%20I%20don't%20see%20anything%20familiar%20here)%3A%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20%5C%5Cu0014ftypqt%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20%5C%5Cu0002%20qt%C2%A0%20%5C%5Cu0001%24%5C%5Cu0003Qmdat%C3%BF%C3%98%C3%BF%C3%80%20%5C%5Cu0011%5C%5Cb%5C%5Cbp%5C%5Cu000f%20%5C%5Cu0003%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5C%5C%22%20%5C%5Cu0002%5C%5Cu0011%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0003%5C%5Cu0011%5C%5Cu0001%C3%BF%C3%BE%C2%A0%5C%5CnGPEncoder%C3%BF%C3%9B%20C%20%5C%5Cu001b%5C%5Cu0012%5C%5Cu0014%5C%5Cu0017%5C%5Cu0014%5C%5Cu0011%5C%5Cu001b%5C%5Cu0017%5C%5Cu0016%5C%5Cu0017%5C%5Cu001e%5C%5Cu001c%5C%5Cu001b%20(B%2B(%25%25(Q%3A%3D0B%60Ued_U%5D%5Bjx%E2%84%A2%C2%81jq%C2%90s%5B%5D%E2%80%A6%C2%B5%E2%80%A0%C2%90%C5%BE%C2%A3%C2%AB%C2%AD%C2%ABg%E2%82%AC%C2%BC%C3%89%C2%BA%C2%A6%C3%87%E2%84%A2%C2%A8%C2%AB%C2%A4%C3%BF%C3%9B%20C%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu001c%5C%5Cu001e%5C%5Cu001e(%23(N%2B%2BN%C2%A4n%5Dn%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C2%A4%C3%BF%C3%9D%20%5C%5Cu0004%C2%A0%20%C3%BF%C3%84%20%5C%5Cu001f%C2%A0%20%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0005%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0001%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20%C2%A0%20%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0002%5C%5Cu0003%5C%5Cu0004%5C%5Cu0005%5C%5Cu0006%20%5C%5Cb%5C%5Ct%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cn%C3%BF%C3%84%20%C2%B5%5C%5Cu0010%20%5C%5Cu0002%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0003%5C%5Cu0003%5C%5Cu0002%5C%5Cu0004%5C%5Cu0003%5C%5Cu0005%5C%5Cu0005%5C%5Cu0004%5C%5Cu0004%C2%A0%20%5C%5Cu0001%7D%5C%5Cu0001%5C%5Cu0002%5C%5Cu0003%20%5C%5Cu0004%5C%5Cu0011%5C%5Cu0005%5C%5Cu0012!1A%5C%5Cu0006%5C%5Cu0013Qa%20%5C%5C%5C%22q%5C%5Cu00142%C2%81%E2%80%98%C2%A1%5C%5Cb%23B%C2%B1%C3%81%5C%5Cu0015R%C3%91%C3%B0%243br%E2%80%9A%5C%5Ct%5C%5Cn%5C%5Cu0016%5C%5Cu0017%5C%5Cu0018%5C%5Cu0019%5C%5Cu001a%25%26'()*456789%3ACDEFGHIJSTUVWXYZcdefghijstuvwxyz%C6%92%E2%80%9E%E2%80%A6%E2%80%A0%E2%80%A1%CB%86%E2%80%B0%C5%A0%E2%80%99%E2%80%9C%E2%80%9D%E2%80%A2%E2%80%93%E2%80%94%CB%9C%E2%84